msgctxt "L_AME_093"
msgid "We're getting a positive reading - \\nthe internal comms hub is nearby.\\n"
msgstr "Signal positif - \\nle relais de com intérieur est proche.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_094"
msgid "You're on the same floor as \\nCassandra's office.\\n"
msgstr "Le bureau de Cassandra est à \\ncet étage.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_095"
msgid "The other hub has got to be in the \\nSecurity Room.\\n"
msgstr "L'autre relais doit être dans la \\nsalle de surveillance.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_096"
msgid "The basement elevator must be around \\nthere somewhere.\\n"
msgstr "L'ascenseur souterrain doit être dans \\nle coin.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_097"
msgid "Security system is now back online.\\n"
msgstr "Système de sécurité opérationnel.\\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_098"
msgid "You vandal, you've broken it!\\n"
msgstr "Bravo...ça ne marche plus!\\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_099"
msgid "2023 AD, 2214 Hours  Lucerne Tower - dataDyne HQ\\n"
msgstr "2023, H: 22:14 Tour Lucerne - QG dataDyne\\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_100"
msgid "Why the big hurry?\\n"
msgstr "Pourquoi agir si vite?\\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_101"
msgid ""
"If Dr. Caroll is not extracted tonight, \\ndataDyne will put him through "
"mind \\nconditioning, and we'll lose our best \\nchance of finding out what "
"dataDyne \\nare up to.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Si le Dr. Caroll n'est pas sauvé ce soir, \\nses supérieurs conditionneront "
"son \\nesprit et nous ne pourrons découvrir \\nles plans de la dataDyne. \\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_102"
msgid "Are they all expendable?\\n"
msgstr "Peut-on les éliminer?\\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_103"
msgid ""
"Don't joke! You have to be careful, Joanna. \\nCode keys will only operate "
"while the owner \\nis alive... If you kill them, the key is \\nuseless. "
"Armed guards are a different matter, \\nof course.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Pas de bêtises: une clé de sécurité ne \\nfonctionne que si le détenteur est"
" \\nen vie. Ne tuez donc pas n'importe \\nqui. Vous pouvez vous occuper des "
"\\ngardes armés...\\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_104"
msgid "What's the target location?\\n"
msgstr "Où se trouve la cible?\\n"

msgctxt "L_AME_105"
msgid ""
"Work your way down the building to the ground \\nlevel. Dr. Caroll will be "
"in a research lab \\nsomewhere in the underground facility.\\n"
msgstr ""
